WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:07.162
In the healthcare case classify each variable before
choosing the analysis Diagnosis

00:00:07.188 --> 00:00:13.020
code is a category Pain score has order Celsius
temperature

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:18.678
is interval Age has a meaningful zero Comorbidity
count is

00:00:18.691 --> 00:00:24.852
created by counting Length of stay measures elapsed
time Also

00:00:24.878 --> 00:00:30.826
choose an appropriate visualization for pain score
and length of stay Finally

00:00:30.958 --> 00:00:35.497
decide how diagnosis code should be represented
without inventing a numerical order
